{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119770","id":3746524154,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7fT2v6","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119770","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119770.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119770.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119770","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119770/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119770/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119770/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/9a434f6b5ec71d0859b63879896239cc678dcab7","number":119770,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix Parallax2D positioning with Camera2D zoom","user":{"login":"bd65-crt","id":271831608,"node_id":"U_kgDOEDPSOA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/271831608?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bd65-crt","html_url":"https://github.com/bd65-crt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bd65-crt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bd65-crt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bd65-crt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bd65-crt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bd65-crt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bd65-crt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bd65-crt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bd65-crt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bd65-crt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Fixes incorrect Parallax2D positioning when Camera2D zoom is not `(1, 1)`.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nFixes incorrect `Parallax2D` positioning when used with a zoomed `Camera2D`.\r\n\r\nWhen `Camera2D.zoom != Vector2(1, 1)`, `Parallax2D` nodes using `repeat_size`\r\ncan be positioned outside the visible area.\r\n\r\nRoot cause:\r\n`Camera2D` computes `adj_screen_pos` using the full viewport size, which\r\ndoes not match the actual visible world region when zoom is applied.\r\n\r\nFix:\r\nDivide the viewport half-size by the camera zoom before computing\r\n`adj_screen_pos`, so the offset matches the visible world area.\r\n\r\nTested manually with:\r\n- `zoom = (1, 1)`\r\n- `zoom = (2, 2)`\r\n- `zoom = (3, 3)`\r\n\r\nAI disclosure:\r\nAI was used to help refine the wording and structure of this PR description.\r\nThe bug investigation, code change, and testing were performed manually.\r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119776*","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull r